<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Cons Modder Dec qtr pre-capex net dips.</title>
<headline>Cons Modder Dec qtr pre-capex net dips.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-01-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter to end-Dec versus preceding quarter</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Net profit before capital spending  3.45 vs 3.50</p>
<p>    Capital spending			  0.97 vs 0.26</p>
<p>Full name: Consolidated Modderfontein Mines Ltd</p>
<p>    Gold output (kg)			480.90 vs 467.71</p>
<p>    Tonnes milled/treated		111.708 vs 113.490</p>
<p>    Yield (gram/t)			    4.30 vs 4.12</p>
<p>    Cost (rand/kg)			  49,424 vs 48,250</p>
<p>    Revenue (rand/kg)		     56,078 vs 55,526</p>
<p>NOTE - The firm said it had embarked on a programme of major expansion, incurring costs re-opening and re-equipping old shafts and areas which have not been mined for 40 years.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
